    {
      "id": "claim_d77fc4d5f11d42d8a7ee5678e2af86b7",
      "statement": "In owner mode the helper creates the named Job, prepares a suspended target, assigns it to the Job before resume, streams stdout/stderr, forwards stdin, stops the process tree in graceful phases (CTRL_C, CTRL_BREAK, then Job terminate), and terminates the Job if the owner identity is lost.",
