      "statement": "The Win32 layer creates the target suspended, assigns it to a JOB_OBJECT_LIMIT_KILL_ON_JOB_CLOSE Job via AssignProcessToJobObject before ResumeThread with an inherited-handle allowlist, and never uses CREATE_BREAKAWAY_FROM_JOB.",
